WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:19.680
quickly tied up Wukong and brought him up to Heaven.

2
00:00:25.562 --> 00:00:28.704
want Sun Wukong destroyed," said the Jade Emperor.

3
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.382
Soldiers tied Wukong to a pillar in a courtyard.

4
00:00:36.484 --> 00:00:37.745
struck him with swords.

5
00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.969
But his body was as hard as a diamond.

6
00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.111
The swords shattered.

7
00:00:46.092 --> 00:00:47.053
Wukong laughed.

8
00:00:47.073 --> 00:00:49.795
"Your swords can't hurt me!"

9
00:00:51.156 --> 00:00:53.158
Jade Emperor turned to a messenger.

10
00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:58.896
"Bring in the fire gods."

11
00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:03.197
Several fire gods entered the courtyard and threw balls of flame at Wukong.

12
00:01:04.358 --> 00:01:06.098
The courtyard filled with smoke.

13
00:01:08.419 --> 00:01:12.740
But when the smoke cleared, not one hair on Wukong's body was burned.

14
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:15.241
"Thank you!"

15
00:01:15.521 --> 00:01:16.361
Wukong laughed.

16
00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:18.602
"I was feeling a little cold!"

17
00:01:22.163 --> 00:01:24.524
the thunder gods," said the Jade Emperor.

18
00:01:26.768 --> 00:01:29.009
Several thunder gods entered the courtyard.

19
00:01:30.911 --> 00:01:34.893
The Jade Emperor smiled as lightning bolts shot toward Wukong.

20
00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:38.475
But even the lightning couldn't harm the monkey.

21
00:01:38.495 --> 00:01:40.316
"That tickled!"

22
00:01:40.656 --> 00:01:42.097
said Wukong with a smile.

23
00:01:43.158 --> 00:01:44.759
Jade Emperor shook his head.

24
00:01:44.779 --> 00:01:49.281
"It seems that Wukong can't be destroyed."

25
00:01:50.462 --> 00:01:54.412
"That's because he ate all the peaches," said Laozi.

26
00:01:54.432 --> 00:01:56.834
"Just one peach would make someone live forever.

27
00:01:58.055 --> 00:01:59.996
He ate every peach in the garden!"

28
00:02:01.518 --> 00:02:02.438
emperor frowned.

29
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:04.160
"Then how will we get rid of him?"

30
00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.562
"I have an idea," said Laozi.

31
00:02:07.582 --> 00:02:11.205
"I'll put him in the large pot I use for making potions.

32
00:02:12.326 --> 00:02:13.987
Maybe we can burn him up slowly."

33
00:02:15.128 --> 00:02:16.970
"Perfect," said the Jade Emperor.

34
00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:24.301
Soldiers brought Wukong to a room in Laozi's palace.

35
00:02:28.482 --> 00:02:30.863
A large pot sat in the middle of the room.

36
00:02:32.283 --> 00:02:39.386
Laozi put Wukong into the pot and then closed the lid.

37
00:02:41.186 --> 00:02:42.747
started a fire under the pot.

38
00:02:44.947 --> 00:02:48.072
Day and night he tended the fire.

39
00:02:48.132 --> 00:02:50.673
He kept it burning for 49 days.

40
00:02:50.693 --> 00:02:55.755
"Wukong must have been destroyed by now," thought Laozi.

41
00:03:02.438 --> 00:03:04.639
He slowly took the lid off the pot.

42
00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:10.541
poured from the opening, and Wukong leaped out!

43
00:03:13.142 --> 00:03:14.083
The pot fell over.

44
00:03:15.163 --> 00:03:17.364
Burning pieces of coal flew everywhere.

45
00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.881
Wukong's eyes were red, and he was coughing.

46
00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:26.102
"That smoke was horrible!"

47
00:03:26.402 --> 00:03:26.942
he cried.

48
00:03:29.383 --> 00:03:32.264
He pushed Laozi, knocking the sage onto his back.

49
00:03:33.644 --> 00:03:37.586
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and smashed everything in the room.

50
00:03:37.606 --> 00:03:40.126
"Somebody, stop him!"

51
00:03:40.427 --> 00:03:41.187
cried Laozi.

52
00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:44.428
Wukong ran out of Laozi's palace.

53
00:03:46.444 --> 00:03:50.328
Gods and spirits fled as Wukong smashed everything in his path.

54
00:03:51.729 --> 00:03:53.751
Laozi ran into the Cloud Palace.

55
00:03:56.853 --> 00:04:00.036
"Your Majesty, Wukong is causing trouble all over Heaven!"

56
00:04:00.316 --> 00:04:00.757
he said.

57
00:04:00.777 --> 00:04:03.519
"What!" cried the emperor.

58
00:04:03.539 --> 00:04:05.061
"He's alive?"

59
00:04:05.081 --> 00:04:07.443
"Yes," said Laozi.

60
00:04:07.463 --> 00:04:10.926
"I took the lid off the pot because I thought he was burned up.

61
00:04:11.826 --> 00:04:13.328
But the fire didn't hurt him at all."

62
00:04:14.368 --> 00:04:15.509
"This is an outrage!"

63
00:04:15.869 --> 00:04:16.910
said the Jade Emperor.

64
00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.871
"What are we going to do with that monkey?"

65
00:04:20.912 --> 00:04:22.573
The emperor thought for a moment.

66
00:04:24.394 --> 00:04:26.435
must ask Buddha for help," he said.

67
00:04:27.495 --> 00:04:28.536
He turned to a messenger.

68
00:04:29.857 --> 00:04:31.317
to the Western Paradise quickly.

69
00:04:32.278 --> 00:04:34.019
See if Buddha can come to help us."

70
00:04:37.861 --> 00:04:42.704
Flying as fast as he could, the messenger headed toward the Western Paradise.

71
00:04:45.456 --> 00:04:48.338
Everybody hid indoors as Wukong ran through Heaven.

72
00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:56.923
Using his iron bar, he smashed doors and windows and knocked over statues.

73
00:04:58.003 --> 00:04:58.984
Suddenly he stopped.

74
00:05:01.285 --> 00:05:05.348
Before him was a huge figure, glowing with golden light.

75
00:05:05.368 --> 00:05:07.509
"What do you want?"

76
00:05:07.889 --> 00:05:08.610
asked Wukong.

77
00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:12.412
"I am Buddha," said the figure.

78
00:05:13.536 --> 00:05:17.199
"Who are you, and why are you causing all this trouble?"

79
00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.301
Wukong smiled.

80
00:05:20.321 --> 00:05:24.864
"I am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

81
00:05:26.065 --> 00:05:27.726
I should be the king of Heaven too!

82
00:05:28.987 --> 00:05:32.109
I'm going to the Cloud Palace to tell the Jade Emperor to leave.

83
00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:36.032
If he doesn't, I'll never stop causing trouble!"
